---
manual: styles.click
lines: [1144, 1151]
testability: interactive
display: any
ledger: E8
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @count = para "0"
  @tap = para "Tap me", click: proc { @count.replace((@count.text.to_i + 1).to_s) }
end
----------- test code
assert_equal "0", para("@count").text, "nothing has been clicked yet"

para("@tap").trigger_click

assert_equal "1", para("@count").text, "a :click proc works on a text block, not only on buttons"
